0 FILE 10183 - 17 - switcher.ldr
0 Red and dark-red diesel switcher locomotive on a 6x28 train base: grille-vented sides with hinged body panels, glazed cab with windscreen and opening train doors, double-curved dark-bluish-grey roof, headlight and tail-light round plates, interior minifig seat and turntable, underside underframe detail, and two magnetic-coupled single-axle wheel bogies
0 Name: 10183 - 17 - switcher.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt
